ent.\\nBy [Oliver Knight](/author/oliver-knight), [Omkar Godbole](/author/omkar-godbole)1 hour ago\\n\\n[Bitcoin used to hate inflation. Now it might be the opposite](/markets/2026/05/05/bitcoin-used-to-hate-inflation-now-it-might-be-the-opposite)Bitcoin is rallying alongside inflation signals, defying the traditional macro playbook.\\n4 hours ago\\n\\n[Bitcoin crosses $81,000, ETH, SOL, DOGE steady as options desks bid on further price jump](/markets/2026/05/05/bitcoin-crosses-usd81-000-eth-sol-doge-steady-as-options-desks-bid-on-further-price-jump)Bitcoin is back above $80,000 after Monday's brief reversal on the disputed Iran missile claim, with options markets quietly setting up for a breakout even as skew still favors downside protection.\\n5 hours ago\\n\\n[XRP slips below $1.40 on heavy volume, tightening range puts breakout in focus](/markets/2026/05/05/xrp-slips-below-usd1-40-on-heavy-volume-tightening-range-puts-breakout-in-focus)6 hours ago\\n\\n[Bitcoin tests $80,000 as Asia’s bid fades and Hong Kong AI IPOs surge](/markets/2026/05/05/bitcoin-tests-usd80-000-as-asia-s-bid-fades-and-hong-kong-ai-ipos-surge)9 hours ago\\n\\n[Hut 8 swaps Coinbase loan for cheaper FalconX deal, slashing borrowing costs as it bets big on AI](/markets/2026/04/28/hut-8-swaps-coinbase-credit-line-for-cheaper-falconx-deal-slashing-borrowing-costs-as-it-bets-big-on-ai)16 hours ago\\n\\n[Circle, Coinbase lead crypto stocks rally amid Clarity Act progress, bitcoin hitting $80,000](/markets/2026/05/04/circle-coinbase-lead-crypto-stock-rally-amid-clarity-act-progress-bitcoin-above-usd80-000)17 hours ago\\n\\n[Policy](/policy)\\n\\n[DeFi lender Aave asks court to block $71 million crypto seizure tied to North Korea claims](/policy/2026/05/05/defi-lender-aave-asks-court-to-block-usd71-million-crypto-seizure-tied-to-north-korea-claims)By [Sam Reynolds](/author/sam-reynolds)3 hours ago\\n\\n[Trump-affiliated World Liberty sues Justin Sun for 'defamation' afte\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_C