{"type":"message","id":"84f9090b","parentId":"537200a2","timestamp":"2026-05-05T11:28:25.269Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I got some good crypto news. Let me summarize this for the user and explain how I can set up a pipeline for them.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nHere's what's moving right now:\n\n**Bitcoin** is crushing it — above **$81,000** and rallying alongside inflation signals (defying the old playbook). Altcoins are also gaining momentum.\n\nOther highlights:\n- **XRP** slipping below $1.40 on heavy volume\n- **Circle & Coinbase** leading crypto stock rally amid Clarity Act progress\n- **Aave** fighting a $71M crypto seizure tied to North Korea claims\n- **Hut 8** swapped to cheaper FalconX financing for AI bets\n\n---\n\n**For the ongoing pipeline**, I've got a few options:\n\n1. **Periodic updates** — I can check in every few hours/days and drop the latest news here\n2. **Specific alerts** — Notify you when BTC hits a certain price, or on specific coins/events\n3. **Daily digest** — One summary each morning\n\nWhat works best for you? And any specific coins/topics you want focused on? (BTC, ETH, altcoins, DeFi, regulations, etc.)"}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"minimax.minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":13405,"output":238,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13643,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777980497020}}
